WEBVTT

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:26.220
Dammit.

00:00:42.370 --> 00:00:45.770
That Kakashi Sensei never fails to keep us waiting.

00:00:46.110 --> 00:00:51.350
No kidding. I could've spent this time getting rid of my split ends.

00:00:51.450 --> 00:00:56.280
Right! And I could've gone back for the underpants I forgot to wear.

00:00:56.590 --> 00:01:02.020
Gross! That's a little too much info.
Who wants to hear about that?

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:06.830
Would you two relax?

00:01:07.060 --> 00:01:10.560
I am relaxed. Naruto's the only hyper one here.

00:01:11.330 --> 00:01:13.870
Come on! Don't equate me with Naruto! Goddamit!

00:01:16.370 --> 00:01:20.270
Sasuke, has your injury from the Land of Waves mission healed?

00:01:20.410 --> 00:01:25.020
Yeah, plus today's mission is a
B-ranking one.

00:01:25.020 --> 00:01:26.050
No problem.

00:01:26.280 --> 00:01:26.610
Yeah?

00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:31.020
Don't sweat it. In a pinch, I'll save the day.

00:01:31.320 --> 00:01:35.390
You're the one who got in my way in the last fight.

00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:38.830
But I came through in the end.

00:01:39.060 --> 00:01:40.160
Right, Sakura?

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:41.450
I wouldn't know.

00:01:41.450 --> 00:01:42.210
I missed it.

00:01:44.300 --> 00:01:46.970
Well, you couldn't see through the fog.

00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:48.400
Kakashi Sensei!

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:49.870
You're late!

00:01:50.370 --> 00:01:52.070
Yeah, sorry 'bout that.

00:01:52.310 --> 00:01:54.810
But today I was...

00:01:55.180 --> 00:01:57.710
trapped in the labyrinth of love.

00:01:58.380 --> 00:01:59.810
That's... a lie!

00:02:02.520 --> 00:02:04.720
We' ve got a missing person.

00:02:05.390 --> 00:02:10.860
A man named Genmai of Inaho Village vanished in the hills.

00:02:12.190 --> 00:02:14.730
You mean he got lost?

00:02:15.300 --> 00:02:17.030
Not exactly.

00:02:18.030 --> 00:02:21.100
I hear there are lots of bandits around there.

00:02:21.440 --> 00:02:24.140
Might even be an abduction.

00:02:24.270 --> 00:02:26.410
Big whoop.

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:31.980
I'm going to be a Hokage! I need a worthier challenge.

00:02:32.450 --> 00:02:34.350
Don't be an ass!

00:02:34.780 --> 00:02:36.920
That hurts y'know, Sakura.

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:39.250
Don't get cocky, then.

00:02:39.820 --> 00:02:42.920
He speaks the truth, though.

00:02:43.190 --> 00:02:47.060
He single-handed!y took care of Haku while I was unconscious.

00:02:48.030 --> 00:02:50.060
But how?

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:53.200
Hey... what're you looking at?

00:02:54.170 --> 00:02:57.410
On second thought… the guy's a numb skull, alright.

00:02:58.310 --> 00:03:01.110
You'd better control yourself this time.

00:03:01.540 --> 00:03:04.050
And just who made you boss?

00:03:04.180 --> 00:03:07.920
I did. Things always end badly when you get excited.

00:03:08.020 --> 00:03:10.350
Why you... Sasuke!

00:03:10.620 --> 00:03:13.950
Stop it, Naruto! Chill out!

00:03:14.090 --> 00:03:17.530
Put a lid on it, we're on the job here.

00:03:17.890 --> 00:03:19.730
Tell that to Sasuke!

00:03:19.860 --> 00:03:22.430
He simply spoke the truth.

00:03:29.370 --> 00:03:32.870
Okay, we'll make this our reconnaissance point.

00:03:33.180 --> 00:03:34.110
Yes, sir!

00:03:35.140 --> 00:03:37.980
Okay! Let's do this quickly!

00:03:38.180 --> 00:03:40.450
No, you guys wait here.

00:03:42.150 --> 00:03:44.720
You've got to be kidding.

00:03:47.290 --> 00:03:49.560
Think something's wrong?

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:50.720
Dunno.

00:03:57.670 --> 00:04:00.700
I sensed something amiss but...

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:02.200
Help!

00:04:08.880 --> 00:04:10.680
Somebody!

00:04:14.050 --> 00:04:15.580
Hold your breath!

00:04:25.260 --> 00:04:27.290
Close call, Mr. Genmai.

00:04:27.430 --> 00:04:29.360
Thank you.

00:04:30.530 --> 00:04:33.300
Why do you know my name?

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:35.000
I'm from the Hidden Leaf Village.

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:37.610
I've been asked to find you.

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:40.040
Where've you been?

00:04:41.740 --> 00:04:45.180
I don't know. I can't remember.

00:04:45.810 --> 00:04:47.450
You don't remember?

00:04:56.360 --> 00:04:57.560
What's that?

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:06.470
Ouch!

00:05:07.270 --> 00:05:09.040
Why'd you do that?

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:12.470
Show yourself!

00:05:16.780 --> 00:05:20.010
You're with Kakashi, aren't you?

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:22.050
What if we are?

00:05:24.790 --> 00:05:28.420
We were wondering if you’d like to play.

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:51.650
Ouch.

00:05:54.950 --> 00:05:55.680
Sakura!

00:05:56.280 --> 00:05:58.450
Let's see now...

00:05:59.390 --> 00:06:03.220
If we finish too soon, we'll be disobeying orders.

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:07.860
I know! How about a game of "try to get her back"?

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:09.530
You're on!

00:06:10.370 --> 00:06:11.600
You asked for it!

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:17.100
Dammit!

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:21.910
You'll have to play a little harder if you want her alive.

00:06:23.350 --> 00:06:24.950
You bastards! Here I come!

00:06:25.080 --> 00:06:26.280
Wait! Hold up, Naruto.

00:06:26.380 --> 00:06:27.310
Why?

00:06:27.520 --> 00:06:30.250
They're expecting that, We will wait for Kakashi.

00:06:30.390 --> 00:06:34.460
No way! We’ve got to keep Sakura in our sights.

00:06:35.520 --> 00:06:37.490
Damn knucklehead.

00:06:40.260 --> 00:06:43.760
There's a few of them, he doesn't stand a chance.

00:06:44.200 --> 00:06:45.130
Drat.

00:06:48.870 --> 00:06:51.910
Where's Kakashi at a time like this?

00:06:54.440 --> 00:06:55.680
Lightning Blade!

00:07:01.080 --> 00:07:04.250
It'll take much more than an attack like this.

00:07:05.790 --> 00:07:09.420
I didn't expect to find his body in a spell circle.

00:07:12.460 --> 00:07:17.200
My only way out of here... is to help him.

00:07:23.570 --> 00:07:27.710
But who is capable of wielding such power?

00:07:29.480 --> 00:07:31.580
Why are they holding me up?

00:07:39.820 --> 00:07:41.290
This looks bad.

00:07:42.760 --> 00:07:46.660
Kakashi should have come along by now.

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:50.100
He must be in trouble.

00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:55.000
I guess it's up to us.

00:07:57.070 --> 00:07:58.610
You think they'll follow?

00:07:59.240 --> 00:08:00.240
Of course.

00:08:00.440 --> 00:08:04.140
Why are we going to such great lengths?

00:08:04.780 --> 00:08:07.550
I don't get our Master's reasoning.

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:12.850
His thoughts aren't as easily read as ours.

00:08:14.220 --> 00:08:17.260
Let's just follow orders and see.

00:08:17.790 --> 00:08:20.990
I mean, here's our chance to be useful.

00:08:29.600 --> 00:08:32.990
Uzumaki Naruto is here!

00:08:33.300 --> 00:08:35.740
Fun and games are over!

00:08:36.850 --> 00:08:38.550
What a strange ninja.

00:08:39.110 --> 00:08:42.550
He stands in the open and even introduces himself.

00:08:42.850 --> 00:08:45.720
Shut up and fight like a man!

00:08:46.190 --> 00:08:47.650
You serious?

00:08:47.990 --> 00:08:51.730
You're either supremely confident in your abilities...

00:08:53.630 --> 00:08:55.930
or too stupid to know your limits.

00:09:03.070 --> 00:09:06.410
I definitely agree with the latter.

00:09:06.670 --> 00:09:07.640
Shut up!

00:09:07.740 --> 00:09:09.710
Thanks to you…

00:09:10.380 --> 00:09:14.050
we've lost the element of surprise.

00:09:14.350 --> 00:09:15.680
You see?

00:09:16.020 --> 00:09:18.120
I told you they'd follow us.

00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:21.090
Leave this to us, Master Kajika.

00:09:21.290 --> 00:09:22.260
Certainly.

00:09:22.760 --> 00:09:25.290
Not so fast! Return Sakura!

00:09:25.430 --> 00:09:29.660
She's the least of your worries.

00:09:32.470 --> 00:09:33.830
They've vanished.

00:09:33.940 --> 00:09:36.600
No, they're still around.

00:09:37.540 --> 00:09:38.410
And coming.

00:09:38.840 --> 00:09:42.910
Well, we can't just stand around here.

00:09:44.110 --> 00:09:45.080
What, then?

00:09:46.050 --> 00:09:48.520
We take it to them. Ready?

00:09:48.820 --> 00:09:50.820
Uzumaki Naruto Ninja Scroll!

00:09:51.150 --> 00:09:51.990
No, don't!

00:09:55.020 --> 00:09:56.760
Sexy Jutsu!

00:09:57.290 --> 00:09:59.360
Get a load of this, scoundrels.

00:09:59.960 --> 00:10:02.500
Not enough? How about this?

00:10:02.930 --> 00:10:04.570
Harem Jutsu!

00:10:13.610 --> 00:10:14.270
Gotcha!

00:10:15.940 --> 00:10:16.980
Drat!

00:10:17.610 --> 00:10:19.250
Little punk.

00:10:19.950 --> 00:10:21.050
Men.

00:10:21.320 --> 00:10:24.650
Did you see that? I rock!

00:10:30.590 --> 00:10:32.960
I'm going to kill him.

00:10:33.830 --> 00:10:35.360
Stay on your guard.

00:10:59.720 --> 00:11:00.920
Sorry we're late.

00:11:02.020 --> 00:11:04.390
So you caught them.

00:11:05.190 --> 00:11:09.160
So now what, Boss? Tie them up with her?

00:11:10.370 --> 00:11:11.330
Sure.

00:11:11.930 --> 00:11:15.070
They were no match for us.

00:11:15.800 --> 00:11:18.240
I was hoping for more fun.

00:11:19.540 --> 00:11:21.040
Got you!

00:11:28.650 --> 00:11:30.920
Your feints need work.

00:11:35.790 --> 00:11:36.760
A Water Clone, huh?

00:11:41.730 --> 00:11:43.100
Damn you!

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:48.070
Eat this!

00:11:58.250 --> 00:11:59.280
Naruto!

00:12:00.250 --> 00:12:03.250
This guy's better than the ones we fought minutes ago.

00:12:06.820 --> 00:12:10.420
Ready to play serious, Uchiha Sasuke?

00:12:11.130 --> 00:12:13.530
Is it me he wants?

00:12:13.800 --> 00:12:17.160
Stop beating around the bush, you pest.

00:12:17.830 --> 00:12:19.170
What do you want?

00:12:19.370 --> 00:12:23.770
I want to be useful to someone I respect.

00:12:24.340 --> 00:12:28.880
Our Lord ordered me to go see what kind of strength you have.

00:12:29.380 --> 00:12:30.180
Your "lord"?

00:12:30.510 --> 00:12:33.010
Yes, "The Wonderful One".

00:12:36.720 --> 00:12:38.050
Over here.

00:12:40.820 --> 00:12:42.320
Fire Style: Phoenix Flower Jutsu!

00:12:54.840 --> 00:12:57.100
Water Style: Water Dragon Jutsu!

00:13:12.890 --> 00:13:15.690
Fire Style doesn't match up against Water Style.

00:13:17.160 --> 00:13:20.530
And his Taijutsu skills are superior.

00:13:20.730 --> 00:13:24.430
My Sharingan can't respond quick enough.

00:13:25.130 --> 00:13:26.430
What's more...

00:13:28.270 --> 00:13:30.840
That last attack killed my arm.

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:34.880
At this rate, we'll be destroyed.

00:13:36.810 --> 00:13:39.350
Seems your arm is useless.

00:13:44.890 --> 00:13:47.150
Shall we say game over?

00:13:49.190 --> 00:13:49.560
What?

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:53.360
Far from it!

00:13:54.500 --> 00:13:57.560
I'll say when it's over.

00:13:58.230 --> 00:13:58.900
Naruto!

00:13:59.970 --> 00:14:01.330
Pesky little runt.

00:14:01.870 --> 00:14:02.820
Forget it, Naruto!

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:04.940
You're no match for him!

00:14:05.040 --> 00:14:07.210
I told you before.

00:14:07.880 --> 00:14:12.180
To sit back and leave this to me.

00:14:13.850 --> 00:14:15.450
Shadow Clone Jutsu!

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:23.360
Persistent bugger.

00:14:37.740 --> 00:14:41.680
Leaf Village Secret Finger Jutsu: A Thousand Years of Death!

00:14:47.220 --> 00:14:48.550
Take that!

00:14:51.850 --> 00:14:53.290
I'm gonna...

00:14:54.160 --> 00:14:55.220
kill you!

00:14:57.930 --> 00:15:01.090
You can count on that!

00:15:06.230 --> 00:15:07.470
Die!

00:15:12.670 --> 00:15:13.670
You…

00:15:14.080 --> 00:15:16.210
Bad idea leaving it to you.

00:15:17.880 --> 00:15:19.550
Two against one, eh?

00:15:20.280 --> 00:15:23.180
Better make it worth my while, then.

00:15:24.420 --> 00:15:26.220
He vanished again.

00:15:26.550 --> 00:15:30.060
That silly technique of yours won't work on him.

00:15:30.260 --> 00:15:32.430
Have any smoke bombs?

00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:34.730
Smoke bombs?

00:15:35.060 --> 00:15:36.130
A few.

00:15:36.300 --> 00:15:38.800
Scatter them around.

00:15:46.110 --> 00:15:50.380
Don't tell me you're trying to escape already.

00:15:58.920 --> 00:16:01.490
Now I can't see a thing.

00:16:01.590 --> 00:16:05.760
That's okay. His Ninjutsu and Taijutsu trump ours.

00:16:06.230 --> 00:16:10.700
Without any cover, he can pick us off easily.

00:16:11.100 --> 00:16:14.130
This evens the playing field a bit.

00:16:14.300 --> 00:16:16.700
I don't see how.

00:16:17.540 --> 00:16:19.840
My arm is useless.

00:16:21.240 --> 00:16:23.440
I can't summon my power.

00:16:24.510 --> 00:16:27.750
But I can still see chakra flows.

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:31.480
Work with me.

00:16:34.660 --> 00:16:37.590
Together, we'll get Sakura back.

00:16:37.690 --> 00:16:40.230
No argument there.

00:16:41.530 --> 00:16:42.230
Let's go!

00:16:52.840 --> 00:16:56.180
Not bad. You've still got some fight in you.

00:16:56.580 --> 00:16:59.580
You missed! Take better aim!

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:02.420
Shut up. Your guidance is off.

00:17:02.980 --> 00:17:04.550
Incoming ahead!

00:17:05.590 --> 00:17:07.020
Whoa!

00:17:07.190 --> 00:17:12.430
Keep moving. Every attack reveals our position.

00:17:12.960 --> 00:17:14.860
I do know that already!

00:17:17.030 --> 00:17:21.870
Well. well, it seems they plan to work together as one.

00:17:22.340 --> 00:17:23.200
Fine.

00:17:32.710 --> 00:17:34.610
Call that hiding?

00:17:39.220 --> 00:17:41.720
We're sitting ducks!

00:17:41.920 --> 00:17:45.660
The fog saved us back there.

00:17:45.790 --> 00:17:47.530
Be thankful, knucklehead.

00:17:47.900 --> 00:17:49.060
Listen, you…

00:17:49.160 --> 00:17:50.960
Stay focused! Ahead of you!

00:17:51.600 --> 00:17:52.800
Heeyah!

00:17:54.070 --> 00:17:56.440
I didn't even have to move.

00:17:57.140 --> 00:17:58.870
Did you hear that?

00:17:59.010 --> 00:18:01.040
Yeah, shut up!

00:18:01.180 --> 00:18:03.880
2 o'clock! Let 'em rip, sure shot.

00:18:04.680 --> 00:18:07.380
Ooh, you make me so mad!

00:18:08.120 --> 00:18:08.650
4 o'clock!

00:18:14.090 --> 00:18:15.590
8 o'clock, clumsy!

00:18:15.890 --> 00:18:17.820
Who're you calling clumsy?

00:18:20.800 --> 00:18:21.900
Fat chance.

00:18:23.800 --> 00:18:26.530
I'm growing a little tired of this.

00:18:39.180 --> 00:18:40.180
Dammit!

00:18:41.320 --> 00:18:43.420
Water Style: Ice Darts Jutsu!

00:18:55.460 --> 00:18:57.630
I told you it was hopeless.

00:19:01.000 --> 00:19:02.440
I guess that's it.

00:19:05.570 --> 00:19:07.270
Game over.

00:19:08.310 --> 00:19:09.480
Guess so.

00:19:11.280 --> 00:19:14.150
Argh! You set me up!

00:19:14.420 --> 00:19:15.720
Go, Naruto!

00:19:16.750 --> 00:19:19.150
Shadow Clone Jutsu!

00:19:40.370 --> 00:19:41.810
I'm not through.

00:19:44.310 --> 00:19:46.980
That's enough. Naruto.

00:19:53.490 --> 00:19:54.890
Had enough?

00:19:55.790 --> 00:19:59.130
It ain't over yet.

00:20:00.130 --> 00:20:02.530
Sorry but this match is ours.

00:20:03.060 --> 00:20:06.670
He may be too stupid to know his limits...

00:20:07.440 --> 00:20:11.770
but you talk up a pretty good game yourself.

00:20:12.840 --> 00:20:13.470
You…

00:20:13.640 --> 00:20:16.280
Better not move. It could kill you.

00:20:22.820 --> 00:20:27.920
Well, your life did prove useful. Good work.

00:20:28.220 --> 00:20:29.320
It's you!

00:20:33.930 --> 00:20:35.230
What's going on?

00:20:36.030 --> 00:20:39.780
Thanks for showing it all to me, Sasuke.

00:20:47.540 --> 00:20:52.880
What's with this creepy chakra? It's not the same guy!

00:21:09.700 --> 00:21:11.030
How do you know me?

00:21:11.770 --> 00:21:13.030
What do you want?

00:21:13.230 --> 00:21:17.470
I'd like to commend you for beating a stronger foe…

00:21:18.070 --> 00:21:22.510
but if you need a friend to help you...

00:21:22.710 --> 00:21:24.840
Forget about beating Itachi.

00:21:26.350 --> 00:21:28.920
You know of Itachi?

00:21:29.120 --> 00:21:30.580
He is strong.

00:21:31.020 --> 00:21:35.460
Much stronger than you'll ever be.

00:21:36.060 --> 00:21:37.090
What's your point?

00:21:38.060 --> 00:21:41.530
How can you be content with this?

00:21:42.360 --> 00:21:46.530
I'll take my revenge on him, one way or another.

00:21:48.300 --> 00:21:52.710
That's the spirit! But time's up for today.

00:21:53.240 --> 00:21:55.610
Who are you?

00:21:55.780 --> 00:21:59.010
We'll meet again, don't worry.

00:21:59.580 --> 00:22:00.680
Step back. Sasuke!

00:22:09.760 --> 00:22:11.620
Sorry I'm late.

00:22:11.930 --> 00:22:12.730
How's Sakura?

00:22:12.860 --> 00:22:15.330
Unconscious, but she's fine.

00:22:15.960 --> 00:22:19.570
We'd best let her and Naruto rest a little longer.

00:22:20.420 --> 00:22:21.530
Yeah.

00:22:22.270 --> 00:22:23.840
What happened?

00:22:25.170 --> 00:22:26.840
I'm not really sure.

00:22:27.610 --> 00:22:30.480
But he knew who I was.

00:22:31.610 --> 00:22:34.050
Our rival was after Sasuke, then.

00:22:34.380 --> 00:22:37.220
But I don't see a purpose.

00:23:13.720 --> 00:23:15.050
You've returned.

00:23:15.690 --> 00:23:19.090
So tell me... how was Uchiha Sasuke?

00:23:20.390 --> 00:23:26.000
He responded well. He has a dark streak that he can't escape.

00:23:26.300 --> 00:23:28.940
You could've abducted him.

00:23:29.070 --> 00:23:31.070
You don't understand.

00:23:31.310 --> 00:23:35.940
He must seek strength by his own, or it is meaningless.

00:23:36.340 --> 00:23:40.710
I see. Then I can stay on schedule?

00:23:40.910 --> 00:23:44.380
Yes, to give him his next test.

00:23:49.120 --> 00:23:52.630
It's your choice, Sasuke.

00:23:52.960 --> 00:23:57.230
If you seek greater strength, then come to me.

00:24:00.070 --> 00:24:03.100
Where were you, daddy?

00:24:03.600 --> 00:24:05.340
Forgive me, son.

00:24:07.370 --> 00:24:09.800
I was completely helpless.

00:24:09.800 --> 00:24:11.840
I feel so ashamed.

00:24:12.180 --> 00:24:14.280
No, It's not your fault, Sakura.

00:24:14.380 --> 00:24:19.520
Yeah, cheer up. We're all safe and we completed our mission.

00:24:20.790 --> 00:24:24.820
I'm upset that he gave us such a hard time, though.

00:24:25.560 --> 00:24:30.000
What do you expect? He was a rogue ninja from Hidden Mist Village wanted by the law.

00:24:30.760 --> 00:24:33.070
His powers were superior to yours.

00:24:33.870 --> 00:24:35.670
That's not it.

00:24:36.170 --> 00:24:37.340
Sasuke?

00:24:39.270 --> 00:24:42.180
My powers are still insufficient.

00:24:43.440 --> 00:24:49.380
I'll need to report this to the Hokage and find out who's behind this.

00:26:25.750 --> 00:26:27.180
Something's wrong?

00:26:28.850 --> 00:26:29.950
No.

00:26:30.220 --> 00:26:33.250
Infact, I was just remembering something frivolous.

00:26:34.250 --> 00:26:35.290
Is that all?

00:26:35.760 --> 00:26:37.620
Yes, don't worry.

00:26:38.860 --> 00:26:39.910
Let's get going, then.
